WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.069
-We don't always
have enough time

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.504
to cover all of the recent news.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.240
So, here with a recap is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.676
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What."

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:12.378
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:15.648
-You guys!
Things have been crazy!

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.718
Okay, first of all, you know
that creep Brett Kavanaugh?

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:21.321
Well, I heard that
when he was in college,

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:25.892
he started a bar fight,
and I was like, "What?"

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:30.096
Then I heard it happened
after a UB40 concert,

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:33.099
and I was like, "What?"

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:37.704
Then I heard UB40 was a reggae
band that looks like this,

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:41.574
and I was like, "What?"

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:43.910
Then I saw a video of a man

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.279
proposing to his girlfriend
on "Jeopardy!"

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:48.581
and I was like, "What?"

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.182
It was so cute.

00:00:50.182 --> 00:00:52.652
He proposed, and then they
went to her with a microphone,

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:55.121
and she said, "What is yes?"

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:57.123
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.123 --> 00:01:00.893
It made me so happy because
if you propose like that

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.662
and you answer like that,

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:05.365
you are going to be together
forever.

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:09.502
And being together forever means
watching a lot of "Jeopardy!"

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:14.139
Then Kanye changed his name
to Ye, and I was like, "Boo."

00:01:14.139 --> 00:01:16.375
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:17.844
Then...

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:19.712
Oh, you too?

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:22.147
I guess everyone dislikes him.

00:01:22.147 --> 00:01:23.415
Then everyone told me

00:01:23.415 --> 00:01:26.385
I should watch this political ad
making the rounds,

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:27.587
and I was like, "What?"

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:31.290
Then the people in the ad
were like, "We hate Paul.

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:32.458
Paul is terrible."

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:33.726
And I was like, "What?"

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:36.895
Then, one by one, the people
in the ad were like,

00:01:36.895 --> 00:01:39.231
"Paul is my brother!"

00:01:39.231 --> 00:01:42.068
And I was like, "What?!"

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:45.338
This man's siblings went on TV

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:48.274
to tell people
to vote for his opponent.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:53.245
I saw that and I was like
[Laughs] "What?"

00:01:53.245 --> 00:01:55.514
Then I was like, "Wait,
Paul's a Republican, right?"

00:01:55.514 --> 00:01:58.918
And he was, so I was like
[Laughs] "What?"

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:03.255
Then at a rally, Trump said he,
"Fell in love with Kim Jong-un."

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:06.025
And I was like, "What?

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.860
Y'all in love?"

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.061
Seems right.

00:02:09.061 --> 00:02:11.598
You're a dictator.
He's a dictator.

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:13.633
Your [bleep] looks like a tater.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:14.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:17.436
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:19.505
Just kidding.

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:22.108
Because according to
Stormy Daniels' new book,

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:26.145
it looks like Toad
from Super Mario.

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:27.413
Yeah, that's right.

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:29.582
It looks like Toad
from "Mario Party."

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:34.553
And I was like, "Why would you
ruin 'Mario Party' for me?"

00:02:34.553 --> 00:02:37.122
Yes, I'm a grown-ass woman
who plays "Mario Party."

00:02:37.122 --> 00:02:38.724
Shut up!

00:02:38.724 --> 00:02:41.694
And then Facebook had
a data breach this weekend,

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.998
and I was like,
"What...else is new?"

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:47.066
Doesn't this happen monthly?

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:49.201
What are they hoping to get?

00:02:49.201 --> 00:02:51.037
More pictures of my cat?

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:54.340
E-mail me, and you can have 'em!

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.975
Just kidding.
I don't have a cat.

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:57.476
Because if you can't
use the toilet,

00:02:57.476 --> 00:02:59.746
you can't be in my house.

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:02.081
Then the Philadelphia Flyers

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:04.116
unveiled their new mascot,
Gritty,

00:03:04.116 --> 00:03:09.822
and I was like,
"What the [bleep] is that?"

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:12.591
See, that's why
I don't have cats.

00:03:12.591 --> 00:03:14.960
Because they cough something up,
and the next thing you know,

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:18.197
that thing they coughed up
becomes a mascot.

00:03:18.197 --> 00:03:22.201
Then Bill Cosby got 3 to 10
years for sexual assault,

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:23.636
and I was like, "What?

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:26.138
He actually got jail time?

00:03:26.138 --> 00:03:28.374
Well, I have lost a bet."

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:32.078
Then I read that while Cosby
was in jail,

00:03:32.078 --> 00:03:34.714
someone threw a hot dog bun
at him,

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:38.685
and I was like,
"Hmm, can I laugh at that?

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:41.387
He's an old man who can't see
and is in jail."

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:43.889
Then I pictured
what that would look like,

00:03:43.889 --> 00:03:46.693
and I laughed my butt off
'cause it looked like this.

00:03:48.193 --> 00:03:49.662
Oh!

00:03:49.662 --> 00:03:52.665
[ Laughs ]

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:54.366
It's fine.

00:03:54.366 --> 00:03:57.570
Then someone was like,
"Will Smith is bungee jumping

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.605
from a helicopter
in the Grand Canyon,"

00:03:59.605 --> 00:04:00.773
and I was like, "What?

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:03.075
Who did what
from the what in the world?"

00:04:03.075 --> 00:04:05.545
People were like,
"It's for his 50th birthday,"

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:08.314
and I was like, "What? He's 50?"

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:09.915
Then I Googled "Men in Black"

00:04:09.915 --> 00:04:12.451
and found out
it came out in 1997.

00:04:12.451 --> 00:04:14.053
And I was like, "What?"

00:04:14.053 --> 00:04:18.291
Then I looked in the mirror and
I was like, "Oh, no, I got old.

00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:20.727
Yet somehow more beautiful."

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:22.228
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:24.330
Then --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:31.336 --> 00:04:33.139
[ Laughs ]

00:04:33.139 --> 00:04:35.741
You're why I behave so poorly!

00:04:35.741 --> 00:04:38.277
Then Trump held
a press conference

00:04:38.277 --> 00:04:41.647
at what I assume was a flag farm
and said this.

00:04:41.647 --> 00:04:45.217
-China has total respect
for Donald Trump

00:04:45.217 --> 00:04:49.989
and for Donald Trump's
very, very large brain.

00:04:49.989 --> 00:04:51.657
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:51.657 --> 00:04:54.660
And I was like, "What?"

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:59.265
I realized that man is in charge
and I felt terrible.

00:04:59.265 --> 00:05:01.901
But then I pictured this
and felt better.

00:05:03.268 --> 00:05:05.171
[ Laughs ]

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:07.173
This has been "Amber Says What."

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:08.708
[ Cheers and applause ]

